            "localId": "relearn",
            "outcomeRefs": [
              "diagnose"
            ],
            "scopeRefs": [
              "scope_1"
            ],
            "title": "Targeted series-circuit relearning",
            "activityType": "Guided relearning and practice",
            "purpose": "Address the specific error identified by the diagnostic with a focused explanation and a corrected example.",
            "instructions": "Review the specific series-circuit rule that was misapplied in the diagnostic. Re-derive the rule from the definition of series connection (same current, voltages add, resistances add). Then solve one new simple series circuit with different resistor values, applying the rule correctly and checking each step. If the diagnostic was clean, this activity is not needed.",
