            "No verified topic weights exist, so all four topics are treated as equally important for this short plan."
          ],
          "tradeOffs": [
            "Only one integrated session is planned because only 2026-10-07 and 2026-10-08 have 25 available minutes each and 2026-10-09 is the excluded quiz day.",
            "No separate practice set, timed paper or error-analysis session is included; those are sacrificed because they would exceed the available capacity before the quiz.",
            "The session is split at 25 minutes so it can fit the two available 25-minute slots without reducing the total work."
          ],
          "unresolvedUncertainty": [
            "The actual quiz format and topic weighting are unknown; the plan assumes a balanced short quiz on the four requested topics.",
            "Whether the learner has prior familiarity with circuit rules is unknown; the session includes explanation so it can serve as first teaching if needed."
